  dialogueCanvas: {fileID: 482061836}
  textComponent: {fileID: 69272660}
  nameComponent: {fileID: 2029556194}
  sentences:
  - Wait, guys... I think I dropped my wallet.
  - What, when!?
  - I don't know, but we have to go find it!
  - But we went to so many different places today, that wallet is long gone!
  - No, I'm not giving up so easily, maybe I dropped it before we met! Let's go to
    the police station to see if anyone's borught it in!
  - Oh... Uhm, I don't know, the police look kind of scary...
  - I agree...
  - I'm just trying to find my wallet back!
  - Sorry... But you're on your own for this one.
  - Yeah sorry, but we'll follow you while we're on the way back home...?
  - Thanks...
  names:
  - Benny
  - John
  - Benny
  - Martin
  - Benny
  - John
  - Martin
  - Benny
  - Martin
  - John
  - Benny
